App Review Extractor & LangSmith Evaluation Pipeline
A comprehensive Python application for extracting structured insights from customer reviews and implementing a full evaluation pipeline using LangSmith.

Features
Structured LLM Extraction: Uses LangChain and Pydantic (StructuredReview, Opinion, and Review) to guarantee strictly typed, schema-compliant JSON outputs from unstructured reviews.

LangSmith Dataset Management: Automatically checks for and creates centralized evaluation datasets (app_reviews_01) in LangSmith, populating them with version-controlled test examples.

Evaluation-Ready Architecture: Designed to support algorithmic evaluation, LLM-as-a-judge scorers, and systematic metrics tracking across task performance, cost, and latency.

